{"id":967249,"title":"23 | 网页剪藏：自动摘要，存入Get 笔记","content":"<p><img src=\"https://static001.geekbang.org/resource/image/c1/52/c145ec25c8a23fc0c5d933aa11317852.png?wh=720x402\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>你好，我是尹会生，关注我帮你把 AI 变成生产力。</p>\n<p>你是否经常遇到这样的场景：在网上读到一篇好文章，想保存下来，但复制、粘贴、整理摘要的过程繁琐，导致“收藏夹吃灰”？</p>\n<p>今天，我将教你如何用OpenClaw实现“网页剪藏”的自动化工作流：<strong>一键将网页链接发送给AI，它自动抓取内容、生成摘要，并存入你的Get笔记知识库。整个过程连贯流畅，让你真正实现“阅读即沉淀”。</strong></p>\n<p><strong>第一步：技能准备——安装“Summarize”与“Get笔记”技能</strong><br>\n要让这个工作流跑起来，你的OpenClaw需要两个核心技能：</p>\n<p><strong>1.Summarize技能：</strong>用于对网页、视频等内容进行自动摘要。这是日常使用频率最高的Skill之一。Summarize是OpenClaw的内置技能之一，你可以通过 /skills 检查技能列表来确认。</p>\n<p><strong>2.Get笔记技能：</strong>这是信息沉淀到个人知识库的关键。</p>\n<p><strong>操作方法：</strong></p>\n<p><strong>安装Get笔记技能：</strong>你可以直接将安装提示词（复制后发给你的小龙虾）</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>请安装 Get笔记 技能，帮我记录和查找笔记。<br>\n技能地址：<a href=\"https://clawhub.ai/iswalle/getnote\">https://clawhub.ai/iswalle/getnote</a><br>\nAPI Key 获取：<a href=\"https://www.biji.com/openapi\">https://www.biji.com/openapi</a></p>\n</blockquote>","comments":[{"had_liked":false,"id":407792,"user_name":"刘杨","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c3","uid":1088931,"ip_address":"安徽","ucode":"9EA64E1BAF3BD9","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/10/9d/a3/827e8d49.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1779440291,"is_pvip":false,"replies":null,"discussion_count":0,"race_medal":0,"score":2,"product_id":101123301,"comment_content":"qclaw没有内置Summarize, 只有内置news-summary \n&quot;此技能应在用户请求新闻更新、每日简报或了解世界动态时使用。从可信的国际RSS源获取新闻，并能创建语音摘要。&quot;","like_count":0},{"had_liked":false,"id":407383,"user_name":"哈基米南北绿豆","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c3","uid":4505399,"ip_address":"上海","ucode":"A79661C8F439D1","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/44/bf/37/791d0f5e.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1778136682,"is_pvip":false,"replies":null,"discussion_count":0,"race_medal":0,"score":2,"product_id":101123301,"comment_content":"Get笔记要会员才能用OpenAPI，一年会员199。在课程里应该提示一下吧。","like_count":0},{"had_liked":false,"id":407177,"user_name":"stephen.gao","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c3","uid":1709474,"ip_address":"上海","ucode":"C34CFD2CDF2D72","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/1a/15/a2/ef2ad404.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1777190758,"is_pvip":false,"replies":null,"discussion_count":1,"race_medal":0,"score":2,"product_id":101123301,"comment_content":"提示要会员才行","like_count":0,"discussions":[{"author":{"id":1336475,"avatar":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/14/64/9b/a029ca39.jpg","nickname":"江南烟雨中","note":"","ucode":"C4D98DFDBF7584","race_medal":0,"user_type":1,"is_pvip":false},"reply_author":{"id":0,"avatar":"","nickname":"","note":"","ucode":"","race_medal":0,"user_type":1,"is_pvip":false},"discussion":{"id":684895,"discussion_content":"199一年","content_length":9,"likes_number":0,"is_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"ctime":1777207662,"is_liked":false,"can_delete":false,"is_complain":false,"is_top":false,"parent_id":0,"ip_address":"湖南","group_id":0,"attachments":[]},"score":2,"extra":"","child_discussion_number":0,"child_discussions":[]}]},{"had_liked":false,"id":406987,"user_name":"陆军第一旅","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c3","uid":1262044,"ip_address":"四川","ucode":"9CC6346D8D4B3D","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/13/41/dc/2361f0bb.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1776654248,"is_pvip":false,"replies":null,"discussion_count":0,"race_medal":0,"score":2,"product_id":101123301,"comment_content":"笔记可以存入飞书文档 吗？","like_count":0}]}